64	 * A single fetch (`origin_facility=self`) returns every request raised by this
65	 * facility; the two tabs are then split client-side, avoiding a second query
66	 * for a filter the coordinator can derive itself. **Incoming** is the working
67	 * tab — requests whose origin facility is also the assigned facility, i.e.
68	 * raised and fulfilled here; the origin facility places and confirms the
69	 * referral itself (it is the BAP consumer), so requests reach this console
70	 * already `approved` and the desk can run the Beckn appointment-booking flow.
71	 * **Outgoing** is every other request (routed elsewhere) and is read-only,
72	 * since booking is the receiving desk's job. The FE never speaks Beckn
