83	 * moment the matching `ON_*` arrives it's the FE's turn, so polling pauses until
84	 * the next action fires. When the awaited `ON_*` lands, its slice is auto-fetched
85	 * and cached by action so earlier slices (e.g. the catalog) stay available.
86	 * Polling also stops on `NACK` / `ERROR`.
87	 */
88	export function useBecknTransaction() {
